    "explanation": "solve.sh applies solution/fix.patch, which is a genuine multi-file source code diff (content-switcher.ts, tab.ts, tabs.ts) implementing the actual interaction-type/selection-state fix logic (e.g. adding an 'activation' interaction type, a `_moveTo` method, correcting capIndex and aria-selected binding) rather than printing or writing a literal expected answer/output."
